ions they are experiencing? Explore, meet interesting characters, solve puzzles and slowly uncover who your mysterious host Mary is and what exactly is going on. How far would you go to save a friend?", "summary": "A Cinematic 1-4 Player Co-op Horror Story Adventure. One of your friends has gone missing. While experiencing strange visions, you uncover a secret bunker with suspicious intentions. Meet the people, solve puzzles, and explore the facility. Meet your host Mary. How far would you go to save a friend?", "themes": [{"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/meet-mary", "videos": [{"id": 203694, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "6gRkmhXTvtc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6gRkmhXTvtc", "title": "Meet Mary Official Gameplay Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/6gRkmhXTvtc/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}